 "sentences": [
  "Dime Mystery Magazine launched in 1932.",
  "It initially published ordinary mystery stories and a full-length novel.",
  "Poor sales forced a major editorial policy change in October 1933.",
  "It shifted to publishing horror stories with seemingly supernatural struggles.",
  "These events always received an everyday explanation.",
  "This new genre became known as weird menace fiction."
